id: pm-vcs-lofj
title: "Working tree, index and status"
description: "Scanning the working tree into index entries, materializing a tree back onto disk, and computing status as the three-way difference between HEAD, the index and the working tree. Materialization removes paths the target tree does not carry, so switching between branches leaves no orphan files."
type: Feature
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags[1]: "area:vcs"
created_at: "2026-07-30T22:37:54.801Z"
updated_at: "2026-07-30T22:55:30.225Z"
author: "harness:claude-code"
acceptance_criteria: Staging then committing produces a tree matching the working tree; status separates staged from unstaged changes and reports untracked paths; switching to a branch without a file removes it; switching with uncommitted changes to a path that would be overwritten is refused before anything is written
dependencies[1]{id,kind,created_at,author,source_kind,author_source}:
